{
 "brief": "An Italian Carabinieri colonel will assume command of the European Union's border assistance mission at the Rafah crossing beginning in November, according to Shehab Wire reporting on a disclosure by Italian newspaper El Foglio. Colonel Vittorio Stingo will head the EUBAM Rafah operation, which provides technical support at the Egypt-Gaza border crossing.\n\nThe mission represents continued EU engagement in Palestinian border management infrastructure amid ongoing regional tensions.",
